  AUTHORS   Yao W, Yoshida T, Hashimoto S, Takeuchi H, Strebel K and Yamaoka S.
  TITLE     Vpu of a Simian Immunodeficiency Virus Isolated from Greater
            Spot-Nosed Monkey Antagonizes Human BST-2 via Two AxxxxxxxW Motifs
  JOURNAL   J Virol 94 (2), e01669-19 (2020)
   PUBMED   31666374
  REMARK    GeneRIF: SIVgsn71 Vpu requires two AxxxxxxxW (A(22)W(30) and
            A(25)W(33)) motifs to antagonize human BST-2, suggesting an
            as-yet-undefined way that SIVgsn71 Vpu works against human BST-2.
            These results imply an evolutionary impact of primate BST-2 on
            lentiviral Vpu.
